        "body": "First Sign-In: Obtain an account and initial password from the supplier, project owner, or administrator; self-registration is not required. If prompted, change the initial password, then confirm that the expected modules and cameras are available.Daily Access: Sign in with your assigned username and password. The platform loads menus, camera resources, and actions according to the account’s role, so available content can differ by responsibility.Saved Credentials: Use Remember Me only on a trusted device under your control. Do not save credentials on a shared or public workstation.Account and Access Maintenance: Authorized administrators can create or edit users in Account Settings, then configure roles, feature permissions, and camera-resource scope in User Role Settings.Password Recovery: Select Forgot Password on the login page and use the email address bound to the account to receive a verification code or reset link. Sign in with the new password after verification; the account’s role and resource scope are unchanged."
