        "body": "Create accounts for new staff, change roles and resources when responsibilities move, correct account details or reset credentials when needed, and withdraw access when staff leave or temporary work ends.If a user cannot sign in or cannot see a page, recording, notification, or camera, first check that the account exists and is active. Then verify the assigned role, feature permissions, and camera scope."
