        "id": "troubleshooting-method",
        "heading": "Troubleshooting Approach",
        "body": "Establish the scope first: one account, one camera, one interval, or the whole platform. Record the time and visible error, then inspect the configuration closest to the failure. Change one relevant setting at a time, retest, and retain the outcome."
